<title>USA: Ashland Coal Inc Q1 net sharply higher.</title>
<headline>Ashland Coal Inc Q1 net sharply higher.</headline>
<dateline>HUNTINGTON, W.Va. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>						   1997		  1996</p>
<p>Revenues</p>
<p>  Coal sales				$163,104	   $139,193</p>
<p>  Operating revenues			 3,504		4,131</p>
<p>						 166,608	    143,324</p>
